    "chunk_text": "Contesting this Parliamentary seat independently, without the backing of established political parties, I stand here today as a testament to the resilience of our people, who demand for accountability, equity and meaningful reform. Hon. Members, as we stand at a crossroads of history, we must confront the lingering wounds of our past with courage, clarity and genuine commitment to reconciliation.\n\nThe Prevention of Terrorism Act, a relic of a wounded, troubled and painful era, must be repealed to restore justice and freedom to those unjustly detained.\n\nSimilarly, the preservation of cultural heritage of all ethnic groups including Sinhalese, Muslims and Indian-origin Tamils including us must be prioritized to ensure that no community feels marginalized or compelled to take up arms again. Our collective history has shown us the devastating consequences of marginalization and we must work tirelessly to ensure that such injustices are never repeated.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0daf\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dad\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db7\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b95\u0bc1\u0bb4\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Chairperson of Committees) \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf\u0d8b \u0d94\u0db6\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da7 \u0dc1\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca \u0dc0\u0dd6 \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd \u0d85\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dca.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 (\u0dc0\u0dc0\u0dd9\u0dba \u0dad\u0dcf\u0db8\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dd9\u0dca\u0db0 \u0dad\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dca\u0da0\u0dd4\u0db1\u0db1\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0bae\u0bb5\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0baf \u0b95\u0bb2\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0b87\u0bb0\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bc8\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bc1\u0ba9\u0bc6\u0bbe) (The Hon. (Dr.) Ramanathan Archchuna) Madam, give me thirty seconds. Allow me to emphasize the immense potential of our diaspora. Those individuals possess the expertise, resources and commitment necessary to contribute meaningfully to the development of our nation. By ensuring their investments are secured and by granting them dual citizenship without bureaucratic obstacles, we can harness their capabilities to rebuild our economy and strengthen our nation\u2019s foundation. This approach not only fortifies our economy, but also reduces the need for our women to seek employment abroad under precarious and exploitative conditions."
  },
