    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "ef6a300a3c1bcb49da3d0acd45239116",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1928,
    "chunk_text": "By any chance, if this Agreement had not been fulfilled, then what would have been the implications to the country? We would have had to face the impact of economic instability, loss of investor confidence, social unrest, a humanitarian crisis and strained international relations. Then, on the other side, by restructuring debt, the benefits accrued to the country are, restored access to international markets -Sri Lanka had been shied away at that particular moment by creditors, where we were not able to even open LCs, Hon. Presiding Member- economic stability, IMF support, improved credit ratings and economic growth. Lack of those were the factors which basically led the country to totter at that particular moment with the leadership of the Government gone, and the responsibility fell on the then President Ranil Wickremasinghe to carry the baby forward.\n\nBut, I must say that we have the right to decide. While they can have their say, we must have our way and that is the way to negotiate with these foreigners. Just because they have experience, it does not necessarily mean that we need to get pushed and cornered. Debt sustainability was looked at and Government debt from 2024 to 2048 was US Dollars 60 billion with the interest and the capital payment. So, debt servicing was looked at. With those factors being looked at, the second stage was over.\n\nThen, the third stage was the most difficult aspect, having to deal with commercial creditors including international sovereign bond holders and the China Development Bank. On the 19th of September, 2024, just two days before the Presidential Election, they come into an agreement in principle and with that, the then Government signs the Agreement two days before the election. It was thought that that was a deal, an election \"gundu\u201d made just before the Presidential Election. Finally, it was proven that it was a done deal. Then, the Government changed."
  },
